296
00:34:03,416 --> 00:34:06,043
What have you done, Lestat?

297
00:34:09,255 --> 00:34:11,256
(GRUNTING)

298
00:34:15,344 --> 00:34:19,097
- LESTAT: More!
- MARIUS: I don't think so, my lord.

299
00:34:19,307 --> 00:34:21,308
- Let me go.
- No.

300
00:34:21,517 --> 00:34:25,020
